  "description": "<p>Throughout the codebase we are throwing and catching URISyntaxExceptions. This is because we are using <tt>new URI(...)</tt> instead of <tt>URI.create(...)</tt>.<br/>\nThis task is to replace the former with the later and remove the URISyntaxExceptions throughout the code.</p>",
